estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Independently measure the reported large ready-work fixture; Account for every response section and total output cost; Honor explicit side-section includes and preserve resumability; Verify lossless tag encoding null-column receipts and JSON/TOON contracts
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: medium
confidence: medium
expected_result: "The complete next response discloses and obeys its effective budget, respects include controls, and preserves tags/null omission receipts without changing full SDK data."
